graph TB
    Client["OpenAI-compatible Client<br/>(via fronting auth proxy)"]

    subgraph GW["vllm-orchestrator-gateway (Rust: axum + tokio + reqwest)"]
        direction TB
        Entrypoint["Container entrypoint<br/>/app/bin/vllm-orchestrator-gateway"]
        Config["Config loader/validator<br/>src/config.rs<br/>orchestrator / detectors / routes"]
        Routes["Route handlers<br/>POST /{route}/v1/chat/completions<br/>listener 8090/TCP HTTP"]
        Inject["Detector injection<br/>overwrites payload detectors key"]
        Fallback["Fallback substitution<br/>fallback_message on detections<br/>JSON + SSE"]
        OrchClient["Orchestrator client<br/>reqwest + native-tls/OpenSSL<br/>optional CA + mTLS identity"]

        Entrypoint --> Config
        Config -->|builds one route per routes entry| Routes
        Routes --> Inject
        Inject --> OrchClient
        OrchClient -->|response / SSE chunks| Fallback
        Fallback -->|reply| Routes
    end

    ConfigFile["GATEWAY_CONFIG YAML<br/>/app/config/config.yaml<br/>routes: pii, passthrough"]
    TLSFiles["Mounted TLS files<br/>/etc/tls/private/tls.crt,key<br/>/etc/tls/ca/service-ca.crt"]

    Client -->|"POST chat completions<br/>Authorization forwarded"| Routes
    ConfigFile -->|read once at startup| Config
    TLSFiles -->|read once at startup| OrchClient

    Orchestrator["FMS Guardrails Orchestrator<br/>/api/v2/chat/completions-detection"]
    Detectors["Detector servers<br/>regex / guardrails-detectors"]
    Model["vLLM / OpenAI-compatible<br/>model server"]

    OrchClient -->|"HTTP or HTTPS/mTLS<br/>8085 baked, 8032 default"| Orchestrator
    Orchestrator -->|indirect| Detectors
    Orchestrator -->|indirect| Model

    Operator["trustyai-service-operator<br/>(historical deployer; no gorch in 3.7-ea.1)"]
    RHODS["rhods-operator<br/>ODH image only; RHOAI offboarded"]
    Operator -.->|formerly deployed| GW
    RHODS -.->|image reference| GW

